<title>UK: Denmark prices $500 mln six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark prices $500 mln six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    17.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.196   PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.596    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAY.02 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
